Modified model materials: experts.bin and resident.bin are converted from the original bf16 Qwen checkpoint into the ExpertRelay weight-only int8 store (symmetric per-output-channel quantization; selected gates/norms/biases retained as float32). Store metadata and indexes describe the converted layout. Tokenizer files accompany the model. This is an existing ExpertRelay store reused by LeanMoE, not a new model trained by LeanMoE. The original checkpoint and these derived store files are not included in the public repository.
